{"channelId":"UCUy0UZE0wdTz_lmLLHapXdQ","row":["Leila The Pet Vet",1450,"Hi I'm Leila the Pet Vet, \nWelcome or welcome back to my channel!  \n\nThis channel started as a way for me to share animal facts and my animal encounters. As I've gotten older, I also want to share my overall TWEEN experience since there isn't a lot of that happening on YouTube right now. So stick around as I share parts of my life, discuss tween topics,  share some tween fashion, while still sharing my love for animals. \n\nI will upload new videos every Friday at 3PM CST!\n\nPlease remember  to SUBSCRIBE and Click the Notification bell so that you know whenever a new video is uploaded. \n\nFor business inquiries you can send an email to leilathepetvet@gmail.com\n\nThis channel is managed by my mom Dionne :)\n\nThanks for coming on this journey with me and I hope you love it!\n\nBYEEEEE\n\nLeila the Pet Vet","leilathepetvet@gmail.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUy0UZE0wdTz_lmLLHapXdQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUy0UZE0wdTz_lmLLHapXdQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:17.093Z","channelId":"UCUy0UZE0wdTz_lmLLHapXdQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"da09e4bd26b3a19a9ac2dd783d18dc18015c440c4e877580d459d09fe9aab2d4","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"026c1e7fe72735a7de6b7a5edabd002ce3b489dfa894e8331536df926e2f24b0"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUy0UZE0wdTz_lmLLHapXdQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:17.093Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUy0UZE0wdTz_lmLLHapXdQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1450,"raw":"1.45K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUy0UZE0wdTz_lmLLHapXdQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:17.093Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"leilathepetvet@gmail.com","purpose":"business","ownerRole":"creator_or_team","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":[